# CLARION CALL: proof the game can be completed, the lonely way. The demo
# player takes the yellow key from the Cellars' second cave (the middle one
# of the chest's three), goes to Cogtown and spends the key on its yellow
# door: a shortcut to the Spire that leaves Cogtown's Hush Engine
# standing. Lady Hush falls, Clary escapes, and Ansel stays behind; the
# Saucer goal is earned all the same (any win over Lady Hush earns it).
seed 2
game clarion
wait 20
cheat bot_goal 2
botuntil state == 2 600
botuntil area_no >= 3 40000
expect key == 1
botuntil region == 4 40000
botuntil region == 6 40000
expect shortcut == 1
expect engines == 3
botuntil world_kind == 2 60000
botuntil state == 9 20000
expect ending == 1
expect goals & 2
expect goals !& 4
expect wins_bad == 1
